Padmini Thampuratti's cousin.

13
00:03:16,813 --> 00:03:19,105
He was a cruel man.

14
00:03:20,230 --> 00:03:23,146
He was a sinister practitioner
of dark magic.

15
00:03:23,396 --> 00:03:27,063
And his Mana was guarded by evil spirits.

16
00:03:28,438 --> 00:03:31,104
Dathan Thampuran, her own kinsman,

17
00:03:31,105 --> 00:03:33,729
desired Padmini Thampuratti...

18
00:03:33,730 --> 00:03:38,730
