19
00:03:38,980 --> 00:03:41,730
But all his efforts were in vain.

20
00:03:41,896 --> 00:03:44,479
But her heart belonged to...

21
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:47,438
Suryan Namboothiri of Aryanattu Mana.

22
00:03:47,771 --> 00:03:50,104
Skilled in martial arts and mystic lore,

23
00:03:50,105 --> 00:03:52,645
Suryan Namboothiri was someone

24
00:03:52,646 --> 00:03:56,605
...the young Padmini
Thampuratti deeply admired.

25
00:03:56,813 --> 00:03:59,437
They fell in love in their childhood...

26
00:03:59,438 --> 00:04:03,146
and decided to marry
and build a life together.

27
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:06,771
Suryan and Padmini's love became a torment

28
00:04:07,230 --> 00:04:09,813
that stole Dathan Thampuran's sleep.

29
00:04:10,021 --> 00:04:13,230
He tried every possible way to
get rid of Suryan Namboothiri...

30
00:04:13,355 --> 00:04:15,146
but failure followed him at every turn.

31
00:04:15,438 --> 00:04:18,855
While Suryan Namboothiri...
was absorbed in his prayers,

32
00:04:19,271 --> 00:04:21,605
When he remained lost in his rituals...

33
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:24,980
Dathan Thampuran ensnared
Padmini Thampuratti...

34
