1387
01:46:10,105 --> 01:46:12,355
Doctor, I know
we are disturbing you.

1388
01:46:12,646 --> 01:46:14,896
But the situation is very complicated.

1389
01:46:15,355 --> 01:46:16,521
Please help us.

1390
01:46:18,938 --> 01:46:20,312
Do you even know...

1391
01:46:20,313 --> 01:46:22,646
where you've come and
whom you're asking?

1392
01:46:22,980 --> 01:46:26,270
Patient confidentiality,
professionalism, ethics...

1393
01:46:26,271 --> 01:46:28,480
these aren't just fancy words.

1394
01:46:29,355 --> 01:46:32,021
Niranjan's personal details
can't be shared.

1395
01:46:32,438 --> 01:46:34,646
Doctor, Niranjan is my boyfriend

1396
01:46:35,521 --> 01:46:37,271
And he has been missing.

1397
01:46:39,271 --> 01:46:40,646
Please help!

1398
01:46:45,771 --> 01:46:48,146
Have a seat. I'll be back.

1399
01:46:48,396 --> 01:46:49,396
Thank you

1400
01:46:58,355 --> 01:47:00,105
What do you want to know about him?

1401
01:47:03,063 --> 01:47:04,146
Doctor

1402
01:47:04,355 --> 01:47:06,813
I want to know what problem
Niranjan is facing.

1403
01:47:08,480 --> 01:47:11,105
He's not just a patient to me.

1404
01:47:11,813 --> 01:47:13,605
He's a good friend of mine.

1405
01:47:13,730 --> 01:47:16,605
[soft music playing]

1406
01:47:18,980 --> 01:47:20,980
I'll tell you everything about him.

1407
01:47:22,938 --> 01:47:24,521
Many years ago

1408
01:47:25,146 --> 01:47:26,646
he came to me.

1409
01:47:27,438 --> 01:47:32,313
At that time,
Niranjan was very disturbed.

1410
01:47:32,730 --> 01:47:34,355
At that time

1411
01:47:34,480 --> 01:47:38,355
to assess whether it was psychosis,

1412
01:47:39,105 --> 01:47:42,480
or schizophrenia,

1413
01:47:43,063 --> 01:47:45,105
or a severe psychotic condition

1414
01:47:45,646 --> 01:47:48,230
It took a while to figure out

1415
01:47:49,980 --> 01:47:52,604
Now, when I ask about his condition,

1416
01:47:52,605 --> 01:47:55,187
he shows severe anxiety and fear inside.

1417
01:47:55,188 --> 01:47:58,563
Later, I realized he is at
an extreme psychotic level.

1418
01:47:58,938 --> 01:48:02,813
For you, your friends, and family,

1419
01:48:04,396 --> 01:48:10,396
this is a very dangerous situation
with a high chance of risk.

1420
01:48:11,480 --> 01:48:13,480
[suspenseful music plays]

1421
01:48:37,146 --> 01:48:39,021
This is all I have to say.

1422
01:48:40,146 --> 01:48:44,313
[soft music playing]

1423
01:48:59,855 --> 01:49:03,480
[scooter engine sound]

1424
01:49:15,396 --> 01:49:16,688
What happened?

1425
01:49:16,938 --> 01:49:18,730
Uncle, Niranjan isn't here?

1426
01:49:18,980 --> 01:49:22,355
Niranjan hasn't been
seen here for a few days

1427
01:49:23,021 --> 01:49:24,312
His friend, Arjun?

1428
01:49:24,313 --> 01:49:25,480
Arjun?

1429
01:49:27,063 --> 01:49:29,230
I haven't seen such a person here.

1430
01:49:30,605 --> 01:49:33,313
He has been living here
alone for a few years.

1431
01:49:38,313 --> 01:49:39,855
Shall we go and check?

1432
01:50:21,146 --> 01:50:22,438
[door opens]

1433
01:50:22,896 --> 01:50:27,021
[tense music plays]

1434
01:50:39,230 --> 01:50:40,438
Where's he?

1435
01:51:01,771 --> 01:51:03,813
[tense music plays]

1436
01:51:19,980 --> 01:51:21,980
[suspenseful music plays]

1437
01:51:24,230 --> 01:51:25,271
Sakshi!?

1438
01:51:30,313 --> 01:51:31,437
What happened?

1439
01:51:31,438 --> 01:51:32,521
Look

1440
01:51:54,188 --> 01:51:55,271
Maya!

1441
01:51:57,313 --> 01:52:00,480
Maya, shall we leave this place
and go somewhere far away?

1442
01:52:06,688 --> 01:52:08,980
Do you know
how deeply I love you?

1443
01:52:13,230 --> 01:52:16,146
After my mother, you're the one
I loved the most.

1444
01:52:24,563 --> 01:52:26,146
Why aren't you saying anything?

1445
01:52:37,813 --> 01:52:41,313
[phone ringing]

1446
01:53:12,021 --> 01:53:13,396
Shall we go?

